                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 409—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Waller to Mr.
                            Eustis</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nimes</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-11-22"><hi rendition="#italic">November
                        22</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Maintain my right of claim for indemnity. Have written.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Waller</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
